WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.720
Well, one of the things people
love most about Domoee is that

2
00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:05.880
you don't need a huge deposit, 
and you don't need a mortgage either.

3
00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:09.680
You simply need the equivalent of 
one month's payment to get started.

4
00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:10.680
Much like renting.

5
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:14.160
It's designed to make getting 
into a home much more accessible.